    "description": "The PTP 700 is deployed to create a point-to-point wireless bridge joining two Ethernet networks, or a point-to-multipoint wireless bridge joining between two and nine Ethernet networks. The Module operates in licensed, lightly-licensed, and unlicensed frequency bands between 4400 MHz and 5875 MHz, in channel bandwidths up to 45 MHz, providing aggregate data rates up to 450 Mbit/s. The Module transmits and receives Ethernet frames as plaintext, and transmits and receives encrypted wireless signals. Variants of the module differ in physical format, regulatory compliance, capacity and color.",
